==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Seared Steaks are a variety of [[Roasted Food]]. They are the result of [[Raw Meat]] that has made contact with [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]].<ref name="Inventory"/><ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 295}}</ref> They can also be found around [[Monster Stronghold]]s being cooked over a [[Campfire]], and they have a chance to be dropped by [[Black Hinox]]es upon their death. The [[Protein Palace]], [[Estan]]'s [[Stall]] in [[Gerudo Town]], and [[Maike]] in [[Kara Kara Bazaar]] all sell Seared Steaks. After being Cooked, their flavor increases.<ref name="Inventory"/> [[Link]] can eat one to restore one and a half [[Heart]]s to his [[Life Gauge]].

